{"id":"35c96ed38b162487","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-mltestnu.md","title":"可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 检验","display":"df-mltestnu — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-mltestnu"],"display":"df-mltestnu — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 检验","label":"43-df-mltestnu","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-compmeasure]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.1–9.9.2，印刷198–200，PDF218–220","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-mltestnu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mltestnu — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 检验"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-mltestnu"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.1–9.9.2，印刷198–200，PDF218–220"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的 Borel σ 代数。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\\)</span> 的Borel概率测度（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}\\)</span> 是以当前固定可计算概率测度ν为参数的开集序列上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\nu(V_n)\\le2^{-n}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\nu(V_n)\\le2^{-n}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>检验以同值 Borel 序列 V 作见证，保留原输入签名；不合格的任意集合序列也不会触发 μ 或 ν 的越域调用。</p>\n<p>本节点限于可计算测度；非可计算测度需要明确其表示及相对化，不能与此定义混用。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.1–9.9.2，印刷198–200，PDF218–220。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-compmeasure","status":"resolved","id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-compmeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的 Borel σ 代数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-compmeasure","status":"resolved","id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度（see [[43-df-compmeasure]]），$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度（see [[43-df-compmeasure]]），$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\nu(V_n)\\le2^{-n}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ba9a251dffb583e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$\\nu$ 是 [[43-df-mltestnu]] 规定的可计算Borel概率测度；$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-mltestnu]] — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 检验"},{"id":"38b337ed607def8b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"7f929e689547cc3b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","8abc268dbc50df5d","7d3f8d3dfdb54f27"]}